program branches

note `when … otherwise … end` —— 两臂的条件。

to classify with n as a whole number giving a whole number
    when n is above 0
        give back 1
    otherwise
        give back 0
    end
end

to _start
    say the number classify of 5 plus classify of 0
    say "\n"
    talk to the machine 60 with 0, 0, 0
end
